WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:08.011
The Daily brief puts yesterday across every location on one screen. In this video, you’ll read the brief, and get it every morning.

2
00:00:09.032 --> 00:00:20.467
Open Operations, and choose the Daily brief tab. At the top are the totals across your locations: sales against the same day last week, labor hours, and food safety checks done.

3
00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:28.978
What needs you lists the few things worth acting on first, most urgent at the top. Each one links straight to the screen that fixes it.

4
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.891
Below, each location gets its own card: sales, labor, food safety, stock, tickets, and who’s on today.

5
00:00:37.928 --> 00:00:48.573
Turn on Every morning, pick the time, and choose email, a phone notification, or both. Send me one now shows what it looks like. Everyone only sees what they’re allowed to see.

6
00:00:49.598 --> 00:00:55.401
That’s the Daily brief. You can also ask Assist, how did we do yesterday? Next, TV screens.

